WEBVTT

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:24.591
Let's go and don't cry, funny

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:27.527
Give me a dumbass dream, please

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:29.763
Don't touch me, baby

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:32.966
Freedom, baby

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:38.872
I'm elastic, I want to be chained

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:43.476
Can you feel it? The nonsensical afterimage

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:55.221
Even the moments of points and lines
disappear after failing to show

00:00:55.221 --> 00:01:00.961
The sad forefront, an empty sensation

00:01:00.961 --> 00:01:06.633
Sweet remnants that tear at my heart

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:12.305
Scattering Polaroids, gathering paranoia

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:17.477
I want you to tell me whose turn is next

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:30.447
If you sleep close to this incomplete
form, you'll understand and see

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:39.432
The damn media's already gotten wind of it.

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:42.669
Won't stop talking about how
a live human became an Amalgam.

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:44.938
He's not an Amalgam.

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:48.772
But that's the only way to
describe what he looked like.

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:58.351
Gerd helped us! Nothing like
this has ever happened before!

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:00.754
That's true, but...

00:02:00.754 --> 00:02:04.891
Besides, only corpses become
Amalgams! Gerd is a living person!

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:09.095
Yes. Gerd became an
Amalgam while still alive.

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:11.531
- That's the only truth there is.
- That's absurd!

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:15.433
Do you know enough about
Amalgams to deny that fact?

00:02:16.936 --> 00:02:20.940
We'll have to wait for the
inquiry into how people, and corpses,

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:23.309
wind up as Amalgams,

00:02:23.309 --> 00:02:25.845
but quarantining Gerd in the
Research Department would be best.

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:31.317
What?! I can't agree to
locking Gerd up! I know he'll be fine!

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:35.321
- I can't let an Amalgam run free!
- He's not an Amalgam!

00:02:35.321 --> 00:02:38.124
How else can you explain how he looked?

00:02:38.124 --> 00:02:40.493
- I told you...!
- Enough!

00:02:40.493 --> 00:02:44.898
It'd be best to keep Gerd quarantined,
but, given his social standing,

00:02:44.898 --> 00:02:47.500
the higher-ups have ordered
we keep him under surveillance.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:48.735
Surveillance?

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:49.769
Hermann.

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:55.508
If you trust him that much,
you and Amanda can watch him.

00:02:55.508 --> 00:02:57.169
Yes, sir.

00:03:19.299 --> 00:03:21.000
Am I a criminal?

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.202
No, it's not like that.

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:26.195
It's just... Could you tell me what happened?

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:30.376
How did you...?

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:34.147
It was a miracle.

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:36.479
A miracle happened.

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:48.357
A miracle?!

00:03:50.196 --> 00:03:51.865
Hard to believe?

00:03:51.865 --> 00:03:55.392
Trust me, I wanna be happy for you, too. But...

00:03:56.836 --> 00:04:02.075
The others say you're an Amalgam,
and that you need to be watched.

00:04:02.075 --> 00:04:05.011
- Do you think so, too?
- Of course not!

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:08.982
I know you! You're not the
kind who'd ever become a monster!

00:04:08.982 --> 00:04:11.017
Then that's good enough.

00:04:11.017 --> 00:04:14.320
So tell me what happened!
That way the others'll...!

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.723
- Sorry, but I can't say.
- Gerd...

00:04:16.723 --> 00:04:19.359
But I promise you this.

00:04:19.359 --> 00:04:24.058
I'm not possessed by a demon.
I would never attack anyone.

00:04:25.865 --> 00:04:28.101
Hermann.

00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:32.172
I think there's a good
possibility he's an Amalgam now.

00:04:32.172 --> 00:04:33.173
Even you?!

00:04:33.173 --> 00:04:38.839
But I also want to believe
he still has the heart of a person.

00:04:41.748 --> 00:04:45.650
Yeah. Gerd is definitely still a person.

00:04:55.061 --> 00:05:02.368
You seemed the most suitable to give it to...

00:05:02.368 --> 00:05:07.473
The others say you're an Amalgam.

00:05:07.473 --> 00:05:09.134
No...

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:18.075
This is a miracle...

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:36.169
Amalgams have been spotted!

00:05:36.169 --> 00:05:38.638
Two of the corpses from the racetrack attack!

00:05:38.638 --> 00:05:41.574
It's been way over 48 hours
since the racetrack incident!

00:05:41.574 --> 00:05:44.377
Yes, that's the normal margin of safety,

00:05:44.377 --> 00:05:46.646
but these ones escaped from the morgue!

00:05:46.646 --> 00:05:50.250
Squad 1 has been dispatched,
but Squad 2 assistance is also requested.

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:53.620
The Amalgams are on Gedser Street,
heading for the A4 area.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:54.454
Understood!

00:05:54.454 --> 00:05:57.590
Sorry, but you go on ahead.

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:59.285
I won't be long.

00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:10.536
Brad! Al! Target from both sides!

00:06:10.536 --> 00:06:13.406
Amanda! You keep them in check!

00:06:13.406 --> 00:06:14.774
Roger!

00:06:14.774 --> 00:06:16.609
- Where's Hermann?!
- He'll be here soon!

00:06:16.609 --> 00:06:20.375
Hurry! The Amalgams are
already a kilometer ahead!

00:06:40.833 --> 00:06:42.357
Fire!

00:07:07.593 --> 00:07:09.762
Amanda! Directly ahead! Fire!

00:07:09.762 --> 00:07:11.093
Got it!

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:33.086
- What's that?!
- Hermann's coming!

00:07:33.086 --> 00:07:35.816
And the other one... is Gerd!

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:58.771
That's...!

00:07:59.879 --> 00:08:01.744
Take us lower!

00:08:19.999 --> 00:08:24.470
The undefeated champion,
Gerd Frentzen, has arisen!

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:26.672
In a form never imaginable,

00:08:26.672 --> 00:08:30.943
he has appeared not on the
racetrack, but before the Demoniacs!

00:08:30.943 --> 00:08:36.549
Those who believe this is a
divine sign for us have also appeared!

00:08:36.549 --> 00:08:40.753
The police and XAT aren't
going to save us from the Demoniacs!

00:08:40.753 --> 00:08:44.991
Gerd Frentzen is! Gerd is our Savior!

00:08:44.991 --> 00:08:50.329
However, Gerd has been taken
into XAT custody for questioning.

00:08:50.329 --> 00:08:52.165
XAT still refuses to comment,

00:08:52.165 --> 00:08:55.334
and the voices of discontent
grow louder by the day!

00:08:55.334 --> 00:08:57.904
You saw it yourself, Captain!

00:08:57.904 --> 00:09:00.907
Gerd is on our side! He's not an Amalgam!

00:09:00.907 --> 00:09:02.108
You bear heavy responsibility

00:09:02.108 --> 00:09:05.711
for dragging Gerd to the
scene without permission, Hermann.

00:09:05.711 --> 00:09:10.383
He's an Amalgam. You put
the team members in danger.

00:09:10.383 --> 00:09:11.818
You still think that?!

00:09:11.818 --> 00:09:14.520
I wanted to prove he's human!

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:15.788
Enough.

00:09:15.788 --> 00:09:18.658
- How are Gerd's tests going?
- Nearly complete.

00:09:18.658 --> 00:09:20.426
Captain.

00:09:20.426 --> 00:09:22.929
After seeing Gerd, I've been thinking...

00:09:22.929 --> 00:09:26.666
The Amalgam that
disappeared at the racetrack...

00:09:26.666 --> 00:09:31.270
Could it have been a living person too?

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:37.043
Interesting. That'd explain why
it seemed to vanish into thin air.

00:09:37.043 --> 00:09:39.645
It turned human and mixed in with the crowd.

00:09:39.645 --> 00:09:44.617
Meaning Gerd wasn't the first
living person to become an Amalgam?

00:09:44.617 --> 00:09:48.144
That, or this isn't something new...

00:09:49.956 --> 00:09:53.526
Gerd! Gerd! Gerd!

00:09:53.526 --> 00:09:57.196
Gerd! Gerd! Gerd!

00:09:57.196 --> 00:10:01.067
Gerd! Gerd! Gerd!

00:10:01.067 --> 00:10:04.798
Gerd! Gerd! Gerd!

00:10:09.909 --> 00:10:12.011
What's with you, Malek?

00:10:12.011 --> 00:10:15.412
It's rare to see you
reading a newspaper excitedly.

00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:18.718
But I'm glad.

00:10:18.718 --> 00:10:23.917
The counselor did say you should
try and connect with outside things.

00:10:25.458 --> 00:10:29.762
I'll be home late tonight,
so you'll have to eat dinner alone.

00:10:29.762 --> 00:10:33.254
The champ... is amazing...

00:10:39.438 --> 00:10:40.769
Yeah...

00:10:42.208 --> 00:10:43.776
Gerd is being transferred

00:10:43.776 --> 00:10:46.445
to a medical research center
under direct military control.

00:10:46.445 --> 00:10:49.815
The facility is off-limits and easy to secure.

00:10:49.815 --> 00:10:53.586
It'll also look like the XAT has let him go.

00:10:53.586 --> 00:10:58.024
From now on, two of our squad
will keep watch over Gerd at a time.

00:10:58.024 --> 00:10:59.692
- Got it?
- Understood!

00:10:59.692 --> 00:11:02.295
Gerd! Gerd! Gerd!

00:11:02.295 --> 00:11:06.891
It's Gerd! A vehicle with Gerd
Frentzen inside is coming out!

00:11:08.901 --> 00:11:14.173
Our very first trump card
against the Amalgams, Gerd Frentzen!

00:11:14.173 --> 00:11:17.143
Looks like you're a bit of a hero.

00:11:17.143 --> 00:11:20.279
Before, we could only
tremble in fear of the Amalgams,

00:11:20.279 --> 00:11:22.982
but now, at long last, a savior has appeared!

00:11:22.982 --> 00:11:26.485
Gerd Frentzen! He, if
anyone, will surely save us all!

00:11:26.485 --> 00:11:29.188
What?! Say he's back again as a racer!

00:11:29.188 --> 00:11:30.923
It's okay.

00:11:30.923 --> 00:11:35.394
If that's what they want, then
I'll fight any number of Amalgams.

00:11:35.394 --> 00:11:37.692
Gerd! Gerd!

00:11:48.474 --> 00:11:51.277
Hey! Gerd! What's wrong?!

00:11:51.277 --> 00:11:53.613
Gerd! Gerd!

00:11:53.613 --> 00:11:57.984
What is it?! Are you feeling sick?!

00:11:57.984 --> 00:12:00.486
No...

00:12:00.486 --> 00:12:03.055
I just suddenly remembered the accident...

00:12:03.055 --> 00:12:07.159
Forget about that! You're
fully back to your old self now!

00:12:07.159 --> 00:12:08.490
Yeah...

00:12:13.499 --> 00:12:16.202
What's all this?

00:12:16.202 --> 00:12:20.039
An insane number of flowers and
messages for you were sent to HQ,

00:12:20.039 --> 00:12:22.007
so we forwarded 'em here.

00:12:25.711 --> 00:12:28.080
You can check your voicemail on that PC.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:30.116
You're free to send whatever you want.

00:12:30.116 --> 00:12:34.086
And... your motorcycle's outside, too.

00:12:34.086 --> 00:12:37.453
You can't leave the grounds,
but I assume you want to ride?

00:12:40.226 --> 00:12:42.194
I'm in your debt.

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.336
He doesn't need watching.

00:12:50.336 --> 00:12:52.065
It's our assignment.

00:12:54.573 --> 00:12:57.143
Gerd! I've been a huge
fan since you were a racer!

00:12:57.143 --> 00:12:59.612
Keep up the good work!

00:12:59.612 --> 00:13:06.952
Gerd. You're our Savior!
May God's blessing be with you!

00:13:06.952 --> 00:13:11.023
Gerd. It's Jil.

00:13:11.023 --> 00:13:13.359
I'm sorry about the other day.

00:13:13.359 --> 00:13:16.028
I was so weak, and...

00:13:16.028 --> 00:13:19.231
If you're up to talking with me again,

00:13:19.231 --> 00:13:23.135
I'll be waiting at home tomorrow evening.

00:13:23.135 --> 00:13:27.373
I'll have the garden
all lit up, just like before...

00:13:27.373 --> 00:13:30.543
Well, bye.

00:13:30.543 --> 00:13:32.443
It's a miracle...

00:13:40.052 --> 00:13:41.921
I'm Gerd Frentzen!

00:13:41.921 --> 00:13:44.151
Now, now! Stop that!

00:15:11.043 --> 00:15:14.947
I'll be waiting at home tomorrow evening.

00:15:14.947 --> 00:15:19.316
I'll have the garden
all lit up, just like before...

00:15:23.756 --> 00:15:26.054
Jil...

00:15:34.233 --> 00:15:36.936
You're not half-bad, either.

00:15:36.936 --> 00:15:38.437
At what?

00:15:38.437 --> 00:15:41.440
That call to Gerd
sounded especially kindhearted.

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.309
There's no doubt he'll come rushing here.

00:15:43.309 --> 00:15:47.513
Of course he will. He's head over heels for me.

00:15:47.513 --> 00:15:51.317
I got rid of him too soon.
If only I'd known this would happen...

00:15:51.317 --> 00:15:56.856
Yes. You should've let him stay
on as a coach, like the owner said.

00:15:56.856 --> 00:15:59.792
But you just had to go and fire him...

00:15:59.792 --> 00:16:01.327
Don't be like that.

00:16:01.327 --> 00:16:05.965
I'd already made plans for lgor to
take his place. It couldn't be helped.

00:16:05.965 --> 00:16:12.104
But Gerd'll come back in tears
if I say I pleaded with the owner.

00:16:12.104 --> 00:16:17.877
He's our cute little bunny.
He's going to earn a lot for us.

00:16:17.877 --> 00:16:20.946
On top of that, I'll be a hero's lover.

00:16:20.946 --> 00:16:23.282
I'm sorry. Goodbye...

00:16:23.282 --> 00:16:28.254
But motorcycles are the only
thing he's good at. It's dissatisfying...

00:16:28.254 --> 00:16:32.953
That's why I'm always here,
to get rid of that aftertaste...

00:16:36.762 --> 00:16:38.430
What's wrong?

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:40.432
Gerd...

00:16:40.432 --> 00:16:44.069
Gerd! Th-This isn't how it seems!

00:16:44.069 --> 00:16:48.140
Gerd! Jil, uhh...

00:16:48.140 --> 00:16:54.146
- She wanted to talk to me, so...
- Yes, Gerd! I asked Matthew to...

00:16:54.146 --> 00:16:56.715
Gerd! I'm so happy! You came...

00:16:56.715 --> 00:16:58.376
Jil...

00:17:00.786 --> 00:17:03.277
Jil...

00:17:04.723 --> 00:17:08.557
Gerd! Stop! Let her go!

00:17:11.797 --> 00:17:16.564
Now, then. Let us sing for Gerd, our Savior.

00:18:01.613 --> 00:18:02.944
Stop!

00:18:14.126 --> 00:18:16.628
Gerd... Why?!

00:18:16.628 --> 00:18:18.897
Gerd!

00:18:18.897 --> 00:18:21.567
I'm...

00:18:21.567 --> 00:18:25.571
Don't move! Put your hands behind your...!

00:18:25.571 --> 00:18:26.505
Gerd!

00:18:26.505 --> 00:18:29.341
Stop! Don't shoot!

00:18:29.341 --> 00:18:31.901
Wait! Gerd!

00:18:33.178 --> 00:18:34.580
What is it?

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:38.744
Amanda requests backup! Gerd has escaped!

00:18:42.688 --> 00:18:45.156
Dammit! Gerd!

00:18:46.959 --> 00:18:49.962
Gerd is fleeing toward E3!
Request pursuit assistance!

00:18:49.962 --> 00:18:51.452
Roger!

00:19:12.017 --> 00:19:13.609
You're...!

00:19:15.721 --> 00:19:19.122
You! It was you!

00:19:38.243 --> 00:19:41.838
Are you hoping to fall, too?!

00:19:43.215 --> 00:19:46.810
Keep your hands off Gerd, you damn monster!

00:20:00.966 --> 00:20:02.297
Stop!

00:20:05.771 --> 00:20:07.204
Gerd!

00:20:22.187 --> 00:20:24.857
You're...

00:20:24.857 --> 00:20:28.088
Do you honestly think you saved him?

00:20:33.532 --> 00:20:35.227
Wait!

00:20:51.416 --> 00:20:55.284
Please! Wait! You're not a monster!

00:20:57.489 --> 00:21:00.458
I'm... I'm...

00:21:12.938 --> 00:21:16.999
Gerd! Gerd!

00:21:47.139 --> 00:21:55.013
The ever-flowing songs search my memory

00:21:55.013 --> 00:22:07.125
The pain etched out by the
times slowly brings me back

00:22:07.125 --> 00:22:10.362
Embrace the sadness

00:22:10.362 --> 00:22:17.803
I know, the days that have passed by

00:22:17.803 --> 00:22:22.307
When I look up, it doesn't spill down

00:22:22.307 --> 00:22:28.880
As it trickles down the window,
sad rain rattles the heated isolation

00:22:28.880 --> 00:22:34.253
Tonight I will be forsaken by sleep

00:22:34.253 --> 00:22:42.060
It's almost as if I'm traveling
to a country no one's ever heard of

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:48.400
I'm all alone, and my words
don't get through to anyone

00:22:48.400 --> 00:22:50.469
Wow wow

00:22:50.469 --> 00:22:58.477
Now my heart is frozen and waiting

00:22:58.477 --> 00:23:05.212
because it wants a phone
call so it can connect with you

00:23:13.191 --> 00:23:16.128
Deceit and vanity run rampant in the media.

00:23:16.128 --> 00:23:22.000
Even so, the truth mercilessly
eats away at the weak.

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:25.604
Episode 3: "The Infection Spreads."

00:23:25.604 --> 00:23:30.268
The black shadow speeds along,
to shroud all nightmares in darkness.
